CASE: current attributable explicit success
state: done · source: run-step · checks green: PR ready for review (still monitoring for merge/close)
CASE: unknown current verdict plus older checks-green event
state: working · source: run-step · validating (running)
CASE: unavailable run lookup plus older checks-green event
state: unknown · source: none · no current-state source available
CASE: remote checks-green event without attributable verdict source
state: unknown · source: remote-endpoint · alive on remote-mac; checks-green event awaiting current attributable CI verification
